{"title":"GenAI Application Developer Roadmap","role":"GenAI Application Developer","summary":"A GenAI Application Developer builds software applications that use generative AI models to perform tasks such as text generation, document analysis, conversational assistance, code generation, image understanding, summarization, recommendation, and workflow automation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"CSE – Artificial Intelligence & Data Science (AI&DS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A GenAI Application Developer builds software applications that use generative AI models to perform tasks such as text generation, document analysis, conversational assistance, code generation, image understanding, summarization, recommendation, and workflow automation."},{"type":"p","text":"This role is different from a pure ML Researcher. The focus is on turning foundation models into reliable, production-ready applications."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Build LLM-powered applications"},{"text":"Integrate commercial and open-source AI models"},{"text":"Develop RAG systems"},{"text":"Create AI agents and tool-calling workflows"},{"text":"Design prompts and structured outputs"},{"text":"Build AI APIs and backend services"},{"text":"Connect AI systems with databases and enterprise data"},{"text":"Implement evaluation, monitoring and guardrails"},{"text":"Optimize latency and inference cost"},{"text":"Deploy GenAI applications to cloud environments"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A GenAI Application Developer can progress into several areas:"},{"type":"table","header":["Career Direction","Example Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"GenAI Application Development"},{"text":"GenAI Developer, AI Application Developer"}],[{"text":"LLM Engineering"},{"text":"LLM Engineer, LLM Application Engineer"}