ised learning"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Clustering"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Hyperparameter tuning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deep Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neural networks"},{"text":"CNNs"},{"text":"RNNs"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Embeddings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python AI Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"TensorFlow basics"},{"text":"matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NLP"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tokenization"},{"text":"Word embeddings"},{"text":"Sentence embeddings"},{"text":"Text classification"},{"text":"Named entity recognition"},{"text":"Semantic similarity"},{"text":"Transformers"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Year-2 target","text":"Understand how modern AI models work rather than treating APIs as black boxes."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Generative AI & LLM Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the critical specialization year."},{"type":"h","text":"Large Language Models"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transformer architecture"},{"text":"Encoder vs decoder models"},{"text":"Causal language modeling"},{"text":"Tokenization"},{"text":"Context windows"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Inference"},{"text":"Model parameters"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Top-k / top-p sampling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"LLM APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to integrate models through APIs and SDKs."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prompt construction"},{"text":"System/user messages"},{"text":"Structured outputs"},{"text":"Function/tool calling"},{"text":"Streaming responses"},{"text":"JSON outputs"},{"text":"Model selection"},{"text":"Token usage"},{"text":"Rate limits"}]},{"type":"